# Legacy zh-tw URLs were SUFFIX-based (/articles/{slug}/zh-tw).
# The Astro i18n scheme is PREFIX-based (/zh-tw/articles/{slug}).
# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify _redirects syntax: `*` captures a path segment(s),
# `:splat` substitutes the captured value. This file is copied verbatim to
# dist/_redirects at build time.
#
# NOTE: If deploying to Vercel instead, `_redirects` is ignored. An equivalent
# `vercel.json` "redirects" array would be required, e.g.:
#   { "source": "/articles/:slug*/zh-tw", "destination": "/zh-tw/articles/:slug*", "permanent": true }
#   ...plus matching entries for /series and /resume.

/articles/*/zh-tw    /zh-tw/articles/:splat    301
/articles/zh-tw      /zh-tw/articles           301
/series/*/zh-tw      /zh-tw/series/:splat      301
/series/zh-tw        /zh-tw/series             301
/resume/zh-tw        /zh-tw/resume             301
